<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12956" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόκροτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beaten</i> or <i>trodden
				hard,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ, χωρίον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				7.15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>: generally, <i>hard,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηλαὶ καὶ ὁπλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.98d
				</span></i>
			: Medic., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτηρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.405
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶρος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				442
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ λιθίνη καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.165
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				155
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without fail,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PGrenf.
					2.89.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>, etc.; cf.<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακρότως.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of style, <i>sonorous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Rh.</u>
				191.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				225.11
			</span></i>.</div>
